    SAMPLE --> SAMTOOLS_DEPTH
    SNP --> SAMTOOLS_DEPTH
    SAMTOOLS_DEPTH --> PICARD_CROSSCHECKFINGERPRINTS
    PICARD_CROSSCHECKFINGERPRINTS --> MULTIQC
